(text "U21: 3.3 V -> 5 V signal only.\nSOT-23/SC70 part needs an adapter.\nC41 close to U21; C42 near servo.\nSelect 5 V positional servo; verify travel,\nstall current, pulse range and pouch gate.\nSeparate power wiring, common ground." (at 284.48 190.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.35 1.35)) (justify left)) (uuid bae229e7-3d7e-5154-93d3-26cf6710c6ba))
(text "INTERFACES / DRAFT LIMITS" (at 17.78 245.11 0) (effects (font (size 1.55 1.55)) (justify left)) (uuid 6912039e-f39f-5abb-a847-adf11d229d25))
(text "Spatula: STEP, DIR, WAKE outputs + HOME input (4 signals). Treat: PWM output (1). PIC pins: see docs/pin_map.md.\nMCP23S17 handles switches / flip / Finish LED. Independent SPI1/SPI2 use 17 GPIO. Treat PWM: RB5/p14/OC2.\n5 V / 3 A is shared with displays/audio; 12 V / 5 A is shared upstream. Motor current, protection and wiring ratings TBD.\nU20/M20/M21 ports are logical assembly labels, not connector pin numbers. No flame actuator. See actuators.md for sources." (at 17.78 258.445 0) (effects (font (size 1.25 1.25)) (justify left)) (uuid 97b5bb5d-4997-5b95-9ecd-fa1d695e6323))
(embedded_fonts no))
